Draw the Legend of Mana Remaster's HD art, when the player has the
Remaster and turns it on. Its room pages: a 2D array texture, a second sampler
for the drawing shaders (which come from the port's src/gpu/shaders, with
texture mode 3 for these pages), and a call that queues one HD cell in the
current batch, so it draws in order with everything else. Its UI pictures: a
second array texture with mipmaps that the port packs them into, a third
sampler (texture mode 4), and a call that queues a quad from any part of it.
The port calls them through src/gpu/hd_textures.h.

